<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[GridView] inputType이 &quot;autoComplate&quot;인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘 클릭 시 목록 확장하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_5e4ebe670bd3d24d" class="chapter_title">[GridView] inputType이 &quot;autoComplate&quot;인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘 클릭 시 목록 확장하기</h1><h1 id="r_49e304bda2eb7f87" class="element heading1" data-element-id="49e304bda2eb7f87"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_ee6e4ac6652ae712" class="element pre" data-element-id="ee6e4ac6652ae712">GridView 바디 컬럼의 'inputType'이 'autoComplete'으로 설정된 경우, 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭했을 때 목록이 표시되도록 설정한 예제입니다.</pre><p id="r_d3110185efb6f800" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="d3110185efb6f800"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00118">P00118</a></p><h1 id="r_1c62a568e9d30f09" class="element heading1" data-element-id="1c62a568e9d30f09"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_c329f72c811647bd" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="c329f72c811647bd"><li><p>inputType이 "autoComplete"인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 목록 표시하기</p></li><li><p>(기본 설정) inputType이 "autoComplete"인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 편집 모드 변경하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_77ae1a6683288f15" class="element heading1" data-element-id="77ae1a6683288f15"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_a017cbc08b66edda" class="element heading2" data-element-id="a017cbc08b66edda"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>inputType이 "autoComplete"인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 목록 표시하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_af2997ede95f4017" class="element pre" data-element-id="af2997ede95f4017">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 목록 표시하기</span>'에 구성된 GridView에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_09e6fb7263e0f2db" class="element step1" data-element-id="09e6fb7263e0f2db"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: 컬럼 'autoComplete'의 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_33ffd8e0ff203c74" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="33ffd8e0ff203c74"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image658.png" width="352" height="118" /></p></div><div id="r_a8aa076d7247cf46" class="element step1" data-element-id="a8aa076d7247cf46"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_3afcede4dda84649" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="3afcede4dda84649">셀이 편집 모드로 변경되고 value에 해당하는 값이 목록에 출력됩니다.</p><div id="r_a73bf630fdca991d" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="a73bf630fdca991d"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image659.png" width="349" height="224" /></p></div><h2 id="r_38dd2c2a25842992" class="element heading2" data-element-id="38dd2c2a25842992"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>inputType이 "autoComplete"인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 편집 모드로 변경</span></div></h2><pre id="r_36699d7b8a2e1917" class="element pre" data-element-id="36699d7b8a2e1917">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">(기본 설정) 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 편집 모드로 변경하기</span>'에 구성된 GridView에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_023c2ef80ce57b2b" class="element step1" data-element-id="023c2ef80ce57b2b"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: 컬럼 'autoComplete'의 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_73fbf09655293584" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="73fbf09655293584"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image660.png" width="352" height="118" /></p></div><div id="r_601ea5c8e29593b4" class="element step1" data-element-id="601ea5c8e29593b4"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_d9169fa4cfe2f085" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="d9169fa4cfe2f085">셀이 편집 모드로 변경되고 value에 해당하는 값이 목록에 출력됩니다.</p><div id="r_ec0c5fe7750f835d" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="ec0c5fe7750f835d"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image661.png" width="355" height="118" /></p></div><h1 id="r_3a21ee1c6a8c5765" class="element heading1" data-element-id="3a21ee1c6a8c5765"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_146568f75038a526" class="element heading2" data-element-id="146568f75038a526"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>inputType이 "autoComplete"인 경우 목록 확장 아이콘을 클릭하면, 목록이 확장되도록 설정하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_33be4b5bc2f1cbbd" class="element step1" data-element-id="33be4b5bc2f1cbbd"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>GridView의 바디 컬럼 속성을 정의합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_4cc3fe8a2ef48ccc" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="4cc3fe8a2ef48ccc"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] viewType="icon"</span> </p><p>컬럼의 inputType에 헤당하는 아이콘을 표시.</p></li><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] directOpen="true"</span> </p><p>GridView의 autoComplete에서 화살표 클릭시 아이템 테이블 바로 열리는 기능</p></li><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] viewTypeIconImage="true"</span> </p><p>calendar나 autoComplete의 경우, 아이템 테이블을 열기위한 화살표를 image로 표시할지 여부.</p></li><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] inputType="autoComplete"</span></p></li></ul><div id="r_5b10271775eeb656" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="5b10271775eeb656"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 5.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View - 속성 설정 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image662.png" width="316" height="255" /></p></div><div id="r_cd94d28439ee6111" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="cd94d28439ee6111"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- gridView 의 소스 본문 예시 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:gridView <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">dataList</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_exam1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:gBody <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"gBody1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:row <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"row2"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:column <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">viewType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"icon"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">directOpen</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">viewTypeIconImage</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">inputType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"autoComplete"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"autoComplete"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:choices&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:itemset <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">nodeset</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_exam_code"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:label <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">ref</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"label"</span>&gt;&lt;/w2:label&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:value <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">ref</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"code"</span>&gt;&lt;/w2:value&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:itemset&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:choices&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:column&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:row&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:gBody&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:gridView&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_b4aab19c414f9842" class="element heading1" data-element-id="b4aab19c414f9842"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_fa516678bf6f8522" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="fa516678bf6f8522"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">[body column] viewType</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">[body column] directOpen</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">[body column] viewTypeIconImage</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">[body column] inputType</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>